---
description: API route handler conventions for StudyShare
globs: src/app/api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# API routes

- Call `getUser()` first. If missing, return `401` with `{ error: "Unauthorized" }`.
- Validate in the handler (trim strings, `DEPARTMENTS`, size/type checks). This project does not use Zod.
- Keep existing JSON shapes (`{ notes }`, `{ user }`, `{ error }`).
- Dynamic `params` are `Promise<{ ... }>` (Next 16). Await them.
- Note lists: `noteFields(viewerId)` then `rowToNote`.
- Auth lives in `src/app/api/auth/[action]/route.ts` (`me`, `login`, `register`, `logout`, `profile`). Add new auth actions there, not a new route tree.
